# The customer's broker since 2026-10-20 (it replaced HiveMQ Cloud).
# MQTT 3.1.1 recommended, 3.1 and 5.0 accepted. Cloudflare terminates TLS on 443.
# Publishes every ~60 s, all stations together at about :27; nothing retained.
# Keepalive <= 60 (Cloudflare drops a pipe silent for ~100 s); client ids must be unique.
#
# No password here, by the customer's instruction and ours: export MQTT_PASSWORD
# for the tools. The deployed observer reads Secret Manager, not this file.
#
# Accounts are per project. saijomqttweb01 is this one: read-only, PMeterStation only.
# saijomqttweb (every topic) is for administration and debugging, not for an app.
MQTT_URL=wss://mqtt.saijodenki.net/mqtt
USERNAME=saijomqttweb01
